{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "魔法之夜迎来黎明，到了“第二天”。", "text_idx": 133, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「——真的真的非常抱歉！」", "text_idx": 135, "plain": "「——真的真的非常抱歉！」", "plain_idx": 135, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6804", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我看着恋人就这样在我面前下跪了。", "text_idx": 137, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我这人真坏，任着性子把新吾的第一次\\n　一个接一个夺走还让他在外面过夜隔天才回家——」", "text_idx": 138, "plain": "「我这人真坏，任着性子把新吾的第一次　一个接一个夺走还让他在外面过夜隔天才回家——」", "plain_idx": 139, "len": 44, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6805", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我罪该万死！让我赔礼道歉吧小樱！\\n　不才纱凪，让你宝贝的哥哥失贞了……」", "text_idx": 141, "plain": "「我罪该万死！让我赔礼道歉吧小樱！　不才纱凪，让你宝贝的哥哥失贞了……」", "plain_idx": 142, "len": 38, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6806", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「小樱，小樱呀！\\n　至少，至少见我一面！让我直接道歉吧！」", "text_idx": 144, "plain": "「小樱，小樱呀！　至少，至少见我一面！让我直接道歉吧！」", "plain_idx": 145, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6807", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「纱凪，纱凪，我们先冷静一下好吗？」", "text_idx": 147, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我把手伸向在樱乃房门前连续磕头的纱凪，\\n抚上她的肩膀，轻轻安抚她。", "text_idx": 148, "plain": "我把手伸向在樱乃房门前连续磕头的纱凪，抚上她的肩膀，轻轻安抚她。", "plain_idx": 149, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……哎呀，呃。\\n在一起睡觉当然是会在一张床上醒来。", "text_idx": 150, "plain": "……哎呀，呃。在一起睡觉当然是会在一张床上醒来。", "plain_idx": 151, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "现在想来，当时她的状态就开始变奇怪了。\\n她先是一脸通红的从床上跳起来。", "text_idx": 152, "plain": "现在想来，当时她的状态就开始变奇怪了。她先是一脸通红的从床上跳起来。", "plain_idx": 153, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然后急急忙忙地穿上了衣服（不过是男装），\\n开始赶人似的，催我回家……", "text_idx": 154, "plain": "然后急急忙忙地穿上了衣服（不过是男装），开始赶人似的，催我回家……", "plain_idx": 155, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "最后甚至还说“我也一起去！”\\n都到了这种地步，再怎么样我也注意到了。", "text_idx": 156, "plain": "最后甚至还说“我也一起去！”都到了这种地步，再怎么样我也注意到了。", "plain_idx": 157, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……一觉醒来之后，魔法终于解除，\\n她这才恢复原样。", "text_idx": 158, "plain": "……一觉醒来之后，魔法终于解除，她这才恢复原样。", "plain_idx": 159, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过，昨晚确实是有特别之处。\\n正因如此，我也像往常一样尽了全力……", "text_idx": 160, "plain": "不过，昨晚确实是有特别之处。正因如此，我也像往常一样尽了全力……", "plain_idx": 161, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「樱乃今天会代替我们，\\n　和濑名同学一起去活动室」", "text_idx": 162, "plain": "「樱乃今天会代替我们，　和濑名同学一起去活动室」", "plain_idx": 163, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哎……？啊……这样啊，原来是这样的。\\n　那就是……那个，她已经……」", "text_idx": 164, "plain": "「哎……？啊……这样啊，原来是这样的。　那就是……那个，她已经……」", "plain_idx": 165, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6808", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「对。现在人应该已经在学校了」", "text_idx": 167, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，是这样啊，已经不在家里了啊……」", "text_idx": 168, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4532", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「意思就是说，只有我们两个在？！」", "text_idx": 170, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4533", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「确实是这样」", "text_idx": 172, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 173, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4534", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪的脸唰的变红，低下头去。", "text_idx": 175, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……也是，现在的她难怪会这样。", "text_idx": 176, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那个……真的很对不起……」", "text_idx": 177, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4535", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哎呀，怎么说呢我也该道歉……」", "text_idx": 179, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "各种意义上。", "text_idx": 180, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "要是把话说清她肯定会全力否定我，\\n所以我不能再往深究，只能做此道歉。", "text_idx": 181, "plain": "要是把话说清她肯定会全力否定我，所以我不能再往深究，只能做此道歉。", "plain_idx": 182, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但、但是呢，做那种事情，\\n　还有那种事情的时候我都是真心的……」", "text_idx": 183, "plain": "「但、但是呢，做那种事情，　还有那种事情的时候我都是真心的……」", "plain_idx": 184, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6809", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，我知道。我也一样」", "text_idx": 186, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我很开心，真的，简直就是人生中最开心的一次」", "text_idx": 187, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我……我也和你一样。\\n　不过现在光是回想起来就羞得我快要原地蒸发了……」", "text_idx": 188, "plain": "「我……我也和你一样。　不过现在光是回想起来就羞得我快要原地蒸发了……」", "plain_idx": 189, "len": 38, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6810", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我终于……变成你的人了，\\n　无论是心灵还是肉体，都已经……深切感受到……」", "text_idx": 191, "plain": "「我终于……变成你的人了，　无论是心灵还是肉体，都已经……深切感受到……」", "plain_idx": 192, "len": 39, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6811", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……我懂的，我也一样」", "text_idx": 194, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "只用“喜欢”这个词，还无法描述我们的关系。", "text_idx": 195, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "那一切的一切都在昨晚第一次地紧紧相连在了一起。\\n那份余韵留在我脑中，现在还无比鲜明。", "text_idx": 196, "plain": "那一切的一切都在昨晚第一次地紧紧相连在了一起。那份余韵留在我脑中，现在还无比鲜明。", "plain_idx": 197, "len": 43, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我真切感受到纱凪成为了我的唯一，\\n我也成为了纱凪的唯一。", "text_idx": 198, "plain": "我真切感受到纱凪成为了我的唯一，我也成为了纱凪的唯一。", "plain_idx": 199, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嘿……嘿嘿嘿……」", "text_idx": 200, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6812", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「真好啊……\\n　我还想，继续为你献出我全部……」", "text_idx": 202, "plain": "「真好啊……　我还想，继续为你献出我全部……」", "plain_idx": 203, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6813", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她扭扭捏捏地说着，小心翼翼地拉起我的手。", "text_idx": 205, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我也是」", "text_idx": 206, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊……」", "text_idx": 207, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4540", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我也想做更多，把你完全变成我的东西」", "text_idx": 209, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我抱住纱凪，在她耳边低语。", "text_idx": 210, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她把整个身体交给了我。", "text_idx": 211, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "只是十指相扣，纱凪都会为之震颤。", "text_idx": 212, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……新吾，吻我好不好？」", "text_idx": 213, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4541", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她用娇滴滴的声音企求着、\\n占据着我所有的视野。", "text_idx": 215, "plain": "她用娇滴滴的声音企求着、占据着我所有的视野。", "plain_idx": 216, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然有些事情干得太过火了……", "text_idx": 217, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是，我们两人已然连接在了一起也是不争的事实，\\n现在的我们已经完全不一样了。", "text_idx": 218, "plain": "但是，我们两人已然连接在了一起也是不争的事实，现在的我们已经完全不一样了。", "plain_idx": 219, "len": 39, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "多一点，再多一点也好，\\n我想和她紧紧相连。", "text_idx": 220, "plain": "多一点，再多一点也好，我想和她紧紧相连。", "plain_idx": 221, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪似乎也是一样的想法，\\n自己贴了上来。", "text_idx": 222, "plain": "纱凪似乎也是一样的想法，自己贴了上来。", "plain_idx": 223, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「纱凪」", "text_idx": 224, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯……」", "text_idx": 225, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4542", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不是侵占双唇，而是在脸上印下一吻。", "text_idx": 227, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "只是如此她的眼眶就浮起了泪花。", "text_idx": 228, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不要光顾着脸嘛……\\n　亲亲我，我要你亲我嘛……」", "text_idx": 229, "plain": "「不要光顾着脸嘛……　亲亲我，我要你亲我嘛……」", "plain_idx": 230, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4543", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她发出甘甜美妙的声音拉着我的袖子\\n把脸凑了上来。", "text_idx": 232, "plain": "她发出甘甜美妙的声音拉着我的袖子把脸凑了上来。", "plain_idx": 233, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这样要接吻也轻而易举了。", "text_idx": 234, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但我故意吊她胃口，只是静静看着她。", "text_idx": 235, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾……啾……嗯……」", "text_idx": 236, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4544", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "结果，我反被她堵住了嘴巴。", "text_idx": 238, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "得偿所愿，我感到深深地满足。", "text_idx": 239, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "对我来说，被纱凪所渴望，\\n最能让我体会到她已经属于我了。", "text_idx": 240, "plain": "对我来说，被纱凪所渴望，最能让我体会到她已经属于我了。", "plain_idx": 241, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……不过同时，我也暗暗克制自己。\\n嗯，接吻的话没关系。不会变成昨晚那样。", "text_idx": 242, "plain": "……不过同时，我也暗暗克制自己。嗯，接吻的话没关系。不会变成昨晚那样。", "plain_idx": 243, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯哈……哈啊……新吾……」", "text_idx": 244, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6814", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……纱凪」", "text_idx": 246, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊、嗯啾、呼……」", "text_idx": 247, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6815", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我想着那就没事，温柔地抱住纱凪，有如将她包裹其中\\n一边主动回吻起来。", "text_idx": 249, "plain": "我想着那就没事，温柔地抱住纱凪，有如将她包裹其中一边主动回吻起来。", "plain_idx": 250, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "怀抱之中，纱凪突然全身绷紧，\\n战战巍巍的、叫人爱怜的颤抖走遍全身。", "text_idx": 251, "plain": "怀抱之中，纱凪突然全身绷紧，战战巍巍的、叫人爱怜的颤抖走遍全身。", "plain_idx": 252, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这让昨夜激情有如梦幻般的、\\n雏鸟一般的反应叫我爱不释手。", "text_idx": 253, "plain": "这让昨夜激情有如梦幻般的、雏鸟一般的反应叫我爱不释手。", "plain_idx": 254, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "当我们分开嘴唇，\\n纱凪又扭扭捏捏地低下了头。", "text_idx": 255, "plain": "当我们分开嘴唇，纱凪又扭扭捏捏地低下了头。", "plain_idx": 256, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯唔……怎么办啊……」", "text_idx": 257, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6816", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「怎么了？」", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「接吻……实在是、太厉害了……」", "text_idx": 260, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6817", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "尽管她知道还有更厉害的事情，但她仍然这么说。", "text_idx": 262, "plain": "尽管她知道还有更厉害的事情，但她仍然这么说。", "plain_idx": 262, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾，我还要……嗯、啾、啾、啾……」", "text_idx": 263, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6818", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她眯着湿润的眼睛，\\n在我的脸上，鼻尖，来回轻啄着。", "text_idx": 265, "plain": "她眯着湿润的眼睛，在我的脸上，鼻尖，来回轻啄着。", "plain_idx": 266, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看来这孩子是真的很喜欢接吻啊。", "text_idx": 267, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾，怎么办啊……我真的，停不下来了……」", "text_idx": 268, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4548", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯……新吾……新吾……」", "text_idx": 270, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4549", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯……纱凪……嗯、啾、嗯……」", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就像是玩火上瘾的孩子一般。", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就像是在说……她已然知晓这和做爱不同，\\n无论如何渴求都不会穷尽一般。", "text_idx": 274, "plain": "就像是在说……她已然知晓这和做爱不同，无论如何渴求都不会穷尽一般。", "plain_idx": 275, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯、嗯、啊呜、啾噜……啾……」", "text_idx": 276, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6819", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪沉醉于重叠双唇，我也专心回应她。", "text_idx": 278, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这实在是，无穷无尽。", "text_idx": 279, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……回过神来，甚至天都已经黑了。", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我到底是怎么回事啊。\\n　明明是来向小樱赔礼道歉的……」", "text_idx": 281, "plain": "「我到底是怎么回事啊。　明明是来向小樱赔礼道歉的……」", "plain_idx": 282, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6820", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「总觉得，我……光顾着接吻了……」", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6821", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「要说的话我也是一样」", "text_idx": 286, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我、我本来不打算这样的……\\n　啊啊真是，笨蛋笨蛋，我真是太傻了……」", "text_idx": 287, "plain": "「我、我本来不打算这样的……　啊啊真是，笨蛋笨蛋，我真是太傻了……」", "plain_idx": 288, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4552", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "嘴上在批评自己，\\n可从刚刚开始就和我一直在家门口抱着。", "text_idx": 290, "plain": "嘴上在批评自己，可从刚刚开始就和我一直在家门口抱着。", "plain_idx": 291, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「估计是，忍耐太久的反作用吧」", "text_idx": 292, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「可能，是吧……」", "text_idx": 293, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4553", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「难不成，我是接吻狂魔？ 是不是亲过头了啊？」", "text_idx": 295, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4554", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "只要一对上眼，就感觉她又想把嘴凑过来。", "text_idx": 297, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她在我的怀抱中，一直垫着脚仰着身子。", "text_idx": 298, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我得，稍微克制一点……不然的话，\\n　就要和新吾一直亲下去了……」", "text_idx": 299, "plain": "「我得，稍微克制一点……不然的话，　就要和新吾一直亲下去了……」", "plain_idx": 300, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6822", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「真那样的话，就会连话都不说，亲到天荒地老……」", "text_idx": 302, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6823", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "确实，比起昨天，今天我们在一起的时候说话的时间都少了。", "text_idx": 304, "plain": "确实，比起昨天，今天我们在一起的时候说话的时间都少了。", "plain_idx": 304, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是……接吻的时候纱凪沉浸在安全感里，\\n　连疼痛都忘掉了吧？」", "text_idx": 305, "plain": "「但是……接吻的时候纱凪沉浸在安全感里，　连疼痛都忘掉了吧？」", "plain_idx": 306, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「话，话是这么说没错啦……哎你怎么会知道的啊？！」", "text_idx": 307, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6824", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那当然是会知道的啦。毕竟一直都在亲啊，\\n　你要是有什么不舒服，一下就感觉到了」", "text_idx": 309, "plain": "「那当然是会知道的啦。毕竟一直都在亲啊，　你要是有什么不舒服，一下就感觉到了」", "plain_idx": 310, "len": 41, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哎呀……真、真是的，我们两个已经完全习惯感受彼此了啊……」", "text_idx": 311, "plain": "「哎呀……真、真是的，我们两个已经完全习惯感受彼此了啊……」", "plain_idx": 311, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6825", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因为害羞而垂下的睫毛，带着一丝色气。", "text_idx": 313, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我下意识的又想夺取她的双唇……", "text_idx": 314, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「就、就是因为这样，才更应该克制。\\n　找到原因了更是容易一直一直亲下去了……」", "text_idx": 315, "plain": "「就、就是因为这样，才更应该克制。　找到原因了更是容易一直一直亲下去了……」", "plain_idx": 316, "len": 40, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6826", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……你说的有道理」", "text_idx": 318, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我猛地收住劲头。", "text_idx": 319, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "尽管如此。", "text_idx": 320, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……不过，分开之前可以再来一次」", "text_idx": 321, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4556", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这次你能主动亲我吗……？」", "text_idx": 323, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4557", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 112, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "对于这样的甜蜜请求，我只有全力以赴予以回应。", "text_idx": 325, "plain": "对于这样的甜蜜请求，我只有全力以赴予以回应。", "plain_idx": 325, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 113, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊、嗯啾……嗯、嗯、啾咕、咕啾噜、\\n　哈嗯、咕啾、咕啾啾、噜啾……嗯呜……」", "text_idx": 326, "plain": "「啊、嗯啾……嗯、嗯、啾咕、咕啾噜、　哈嗯、咕啾、咕啾啾、噜啾……嗯呜……」", "plain_idx": 327, "len": 40, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6829", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 114, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呼啊，新吾，舌头进来了……不行，这样子，\\n　这样不就没法分开了吗……嗯啾，嗯嗯……」", "text_idx": 329, "plain": "「呼啊，新吾，舌头进来了……不行，这样子，　这样不就没法分开了吗……嗯啾，嗯嗯……」", "plain_idx": 330, "len": 44, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6830", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 115, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "似乎是我拼过头了，这之后又过一个小时，\\n我一直都在品味纱凪的嘴唇。", "text_idx": 332, "plain": "似乎是我拼过头了，这之后又过一个小时，我一直都在品味纱凪的嘴唇。", "plain_idx": 333, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 116, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "确实就像是刚刚玩火上瘾的小孩。", "text_idx": 334, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 117, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是……我感觉这之后我们，还是会一直这样。", "text_idx": 335, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
